#: main.cpp:37 toplevel.cpp:48
msgid "KAppfinder"
msgstr "Kappfinder"

#: toplevel.cpp:51
msgid ""
"The application finder looks for legacy applications on your system and adds "
"them to the KDE menu system. Click 'Scan' to begin, select the desired "
"applications and then click 'Apply'."
msgstr ""
"Die aansoek soeker kyk vir oorgeërfde programme op jou stelsel en voeg by "
"hulle na Die Kde kieslys stelsel. Kliek 'Scan' na begin, kies Die verlangde "
"programme en dan word Kliek 'Apply'."

